        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;*1 &lt;b&gt;Four client tools&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AWS CLI, s5cmd, rclone, and Mountpoint for Amazon S3. Checked on real hardware from an EC2 instance in ap-northeast-1 on 2026-11-24 (one configuration, one run each).&lt;br&gt;*2 &lt;b&gt;The copy measured on real hardware ran only from bucket to volume&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;With AWS CLI, s5cmd, and rclone. The other direction is in a Playbook record. The documents say one Region only. Owner, mode, and modification time were not carried over (a Playbook measurement, root user configuration only).&lt;br&gt;*3 &lt;b&gt;The AWS services in the frame are expectations from documents&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Not checked on real hardware in this repository.&lt;br&gt;*4 &lt;b&gt;Where the NFS / SMB clients run is not specified&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The figure does not show VPC or on premises." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
